        "kind": "COORDINATE_ORIGIN",
        "detail": "Map patch coordinates are global authoring au with origin [0,0]. Gameplay projection uses originAu [640,440] and tile=(au-origin)/U over a 200x200 runtime grid. Raw au must NOT be compared directly to Gameplay tile indices.",
