        "id": "CMP-03",
        "kind": "STATIC_COLLISION_SEAM",
        "detail": "projectVeyra() returns statics: [] and derives POI containment only from canonical foot polygons. It never reads LR01 geometryAdapters.collision.staticWalls, so physical POI walls/doorways do not exist in the runtime World.",
